# Keep the build context small and free of secrets: dependency trees, build output, agent
# workspaces and local config stay out. Everything else in the repository is sent; the
# Dockerfile's COPY lines pick what each stage uses.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.superpowers
docs/superpowers
.playwright-mcp
junit.xml
*.log
.env
.env.*
